{"id":"muli03qm-f6n4od","at":"2026-09-28T17:05:07.822Z","listId":"main","label":"Manabase pass: Planar Nexus, Hall of Echoes, 9th Wastes","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot approved 2026-09-28 (manabase optimization pass after the FRA review): cut lands whose abilities rarely get paid because the mana is better spent developing and paying Ultron's trigger. Fomori Vault -> Planar Nexus (every nonbasic land type, so it is an Urza's Mine, Power-Plant AND Tower — official ruling 2024-06-07 — any one Tron land plus Nexus makes Tron mana). Mirrorpool -> Hall of Echoes (untapped, every turn, legend rule off; copies Ultron or Memnarch). Rogue's Passage -> a 9th Wastes ({4} unblockable rarely paid; Blightsteel has trample, Krang gives flying). Wastes 8 -> 9 also lifts Extraplanar Lens (2+ Wastes by T6: 25% -> 30%). Tapped lands 3 -> 2.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Planar Nexus","section":"Lands","replaces":"Fomori Vault"},{"op":"add","name":"Hall of Echoes","section":"Lands","replaces":"Mirrorpool"},{"op":"remove","name":"Fomori Vault"},{"op":"remove","name":"Mirrorpool"},{"op":"remove","name":"Rogue's Passage"},{"op":"qty","name":"Wastes","qty":9}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-09-28-1705-main-manabase-pass-planar-nexus-hall-of-echoes-9th-wastes.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":34,"nonland":66,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":4.55,"avgMvNonZero":4.76,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":2,"noncreature":1},{"mv":"1","creature":0,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"2","creature":2,"noncreature":4},{"mv":"3","creature":6,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"4","creature":4,"noncreature":10},{"mv":"5","creature":3,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"6","creature":2,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"7+","creature":9,"noncreature":5}]},"types":{"creature":28,"instant":3,"sorcery":1,"artifact":58,"enchantment":1,"planeswalker":2,"battle":0,"land":34},"color":{"identity":[],"pips":{"W":0,"U":0,"B":0,"R":0,"G":0},"sources":{"W":5,"U":5,"B":5,"R":5,"G":5}},"roles":{"sections":{"Commander":1,"Lands":34,"Ramp / 