{"id":"muo1un1v-kpt3ju","at":"2026-09-30T11:56:17.587Z","listId":"main","label":"Omnath, Locus of the Void in, Null Elemental Blast out (trial)","author":"user","rationale":"Pilot's call, trial: see if the deck struggles without NEB. Omnath banks unspent mana across turns (becomes colourless, CR 500.5/614.5), so Unwinding Clock's opponent-turn rock mana, Karn's upkeep mana and own-turn surplus all carry into Walking Ballista, Hangarback, Kozilek's Command, Hall of Echoes and Ultron's {2}. Landfall {C}{C}, doubled by Echoes. Costs: not an artifact (no Ultron copy, no Workshop/Karn/Mightstone mana, no Foundry Inspector); Jhoira's -1 and Ugin Ineffable -2 apply; Gateway/Amulet deploy it for {4}. NEB: multicolour only, Workshop can't pay, top of the 09-10/09-16/09-28 cut tables. Interaction 9 -> 8, MV<=2 12 -> 11.","entries":[{"op":"add","name":"Omnath, Locus of the Void","section":"Payoffs & Engines","replaces":"Null Elemental Blast"},{"op":"remove","name":"Null Elemental Blast"}],"snapshot":"versions/2026-09-30-1156-main-omnath-locus-of-the-void-in-null-elemental-blast-out-trial.json","before":{"size":{"total":100,"target":100,"lands":34,"nonland":66,"commanders":1},"curve":{"avgMv":4.55,"avgMvNonZero":4.76,"histogram":[{"mv":"0","creature":2,"noncreature":1},{"mv":"1","creature":0,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"2","creature":2,"noncreature":4},{"mv":"3","creature":6,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"4","creature":4,"noncreature":10},{"mv":"5","creature":3,"noncreature":6},{"mv":"6","creature":2,"noncreature":3},{"mv":"7+","creature":9,"noncreature":5}]},"types":{"creature":28,"instant":3,"sorcery":1,"artifact":58,"enchantment":1,"planeswalker":2,"battle":0,"land":34},"color":{"identity":[],"pips":{"W":0,"U":0,"B":0,"R":0,"G":0},"sources":{"W":6,"U":6,"B":6,"R":6,"G":6}},"roles":{"sections":{"Commander":1,"Lands":34,"Ramp / Mana Rocks":13,"Cost Reduction":4,"Card Draw":7,"Removal & Interaction":9,"Copy Engines":7,"Deployers":2,"Payoffs & Engines":10,"Bombs & ETB Artifacts":10,"Protect